.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt SET_CLEAR 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm set_clear
.Nd clear all elements from a hash set
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In set.h
.Ft void
.Fn set_clear "set_t *set"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn set_clear
function removes and deallocates all stored elements from the hash set
.Fa set ,
resetting it to an empty state without freeing the primary table allocation.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr set_free 3